  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shift and slide through the verges of the shadow world.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Shadow Ghost<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to your effective caster level for all purposes related to your racial spell-like abilities, including at what level you can access those abilities. You can use your spell-like abilities more often than once per day by expending one use of mythic power per additional use. You may also expend mythic power to use the mythic version of any of your spell-like abilities, and if you know the spells of the same name you can cast them as mythic spells, as if you had learned them with Mythic Spell Lore.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc47\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
